          %title
          %p Thierry Coquand is a professor in computer science at the University of Gothenburg, Sweden.
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "http://www.cse.chalmers.se/~coquand/"} webpage
          %h2#selected_writings Selected writings
          %p
            Introducing the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/calculus+of+constructions"} calculus of constructions
            that later forms the basis of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proof+assistant"} proof assistant
            = succeed ":" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coq"} Coq
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G%C3%A9rard+Huet"} Gérard Huet
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Calculus of Constructions
              %strong 530
              (1986) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://hal.inria.fr/inria-00076024/en/"}> inria:00076024
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://hal.inria.fr/docs/00/07/60/24/PDF/RR-0530.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            Introducing the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inductive+types"} inductive types
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+theory"} type theory
            which later became the foundations of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/calculus+of+inductive+constructions"} calculus of inductive constructions
            used by
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Coq"} Coq
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christine+Paulin"} Christine Paulin
              = succeed "," do
                %em Inductively defined types
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 417
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-52335-9_47"} doi:10.1007/3-540-52335-9_47
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homological+algebra"} homological algebra
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+mathematics"} constructive mathematics
            via
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+theory"} type theory
          %ul
            %li#CoquandSpiwack
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arnaud+Spiwack"} Arnaud Spiwack
              = succeed "," do
                %em Towards constructive homological algebra in type theory
              = succeed "," do
                %em Towards Mechanized Mathematical Assistants. MKM Calculemus 2007
              %strong 4573
              Springer (2007) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-540-73086-6_4"}> doi:10.1007/978-3-540-73086-6_4
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://hal.inria.fr/inria-00432525/document"} pdf
          %p
            Discussion of notions of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+sets"} finite sets
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/constructive+mathematics"} constructive mathematics
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Arnaud+Spiwack"}> Arnaud Spiwack
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"} Thierry Coquand
              = succeed "," do
                %em Constructively Finite?
              = succeed "," do
                %em Contribuciones cientifícas en honor de Mirian Andrés Gómez
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://inria.hal.science/inria-00503917"} inria-00503917
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity+types"} identity types
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dependent+type+theory"} dependent type theory
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"}> homotopy type theory
            ):
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              , slides 26-28 of:
              %em Equality and dependent type theory
              (2011) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://www.cse.chalmers.se/~coquand/equality.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Coquand-EqualityAndDependentTypeTheory.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            On the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structure+identity+principle"} structure identity principle
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nils+Anders+Danielsson"} Nils Anders Danielsson
              = succeed "," do
                %em Isomorphism is equality
              %strong 24
              4 (2013) 1105-1120 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.indag.2013.09.002"}> doi:10.1016/j.indag.2013.09.002
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weakly+constant+functions"} weakly constant functions
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/propositional+truncation"} propositional truncation
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nicolai+Kraus"}> Nicolai Kraus
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mart%C3%ADn+Escard%C3%B3"} Martín Escardó
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"} Thierry Coquand
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thorsten+Altenkirch"} Thorsten Altenkirch
              = succeed "," do
                %em Notions of Anonymous Existence in Martin-Löf Type Theory
              %strong 13
              1 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.23638/LMCS-13(1:15)2017"}> doi:10.23638/LMCS-13(1:15)2017
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1610.03346"} arXiv:1610.03346
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+algebraic+geometry"} synthetic algebraic geometry
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Felix+Cherubini"}> Felix Cherubini
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"} Thierry Coquand
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Hutzler"} Matthias Hutzler
              = succeed "," do
                %em A foundation for synthetic algebraic geometry
              %strong 34
              Special Issue 9:
              %em Advances in Homotopy type theory
              (2024) 1008-1053 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/S0960129524000239"}> doi:10.1017/S0960129524000239
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.00073"} arXiv:2307.00073
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+spaces"} projective spaces
            in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+algebraic+geometry"} synthetic algebraic geometry
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Felix+Cherubini"}> Felix Cherubini
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"} Thierry Coquand
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Hutzler"} Matthias Hutzler
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+W%C3%A4rn"} David Wärn
              %em Projective Space in Synthetic Algebraic Geometry
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.13916"}> arxiv:2405.13916
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            On
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+Stone+duality"} synthetic Stone duality
          %ul
            %li#CCGM24
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Felix+Cherubini"}> Felix Cherubini
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"} Thierry Coquand
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Freek+Geerligs"} Freek Geerligs
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hugo+Moeneclaey"} Hugo Moeneclaey
              %em A Foundation for Synthetic Stone Duality
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.03203"}> arXiv:2412.03203
              )
          %p
            On Châtelet’s theorem in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+algebraic+geometry"} synthetic algebraic geometry
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thierry+Coquand"}> Thierry Coquand
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hugo+Moeneclaey"} Hugo Moeneclaey
